WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:22.730
The Big Five played their trump card, Five-Headed Dragon.

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:28.260
But the power of my bond with Jonouchi is stronger than Five-Headed Dragon.

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:31.830
We defeated The Big Five and won the duel.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:38.860
But before we could retrieve Honda's body, Noa erased The Big Five.

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:42.360
Noa, what are you planning?

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:49.020
Noa vs Seto
The Duel at Creation

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:57.440
What are you doing?

00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:01.710
Honda, I'll now accept the fact that you can't return to normal.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.450
Don't accept it!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:07.440
But we can't let Noa have Mokuba.

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:11.840
What's that got to do with shaking me?

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:14.850
We're totally lost.

00:02:14.850 --> 00:02:20.090
So to find their location, you're our only lead because this world created your body.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:22.890
Your body must have a secret device.

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.340
Stop!

00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:27.330
Lots of buttons.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.560
How's this?

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:37.270
What are you doing?

00:02:37.560 --> 00:02:38.970
What about this button?

00:02:50.840 --> 00:02:52.240
Wrong button.

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:54.200
Which button do you think, Yugi?

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:57.560
Is this button for emergencies?

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:03.560
Emergency mode.

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:05.640
What's happening, Honda?

00:03:16.620 --> 00:03:18.580
It's Kaiba Land!

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.200
You came to pick me up?

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.340
Welcome, Seto.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:08.820
Welcome to my world.

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:10.560
Noa!

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:19.370
Brother, who's that?

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.870
He looks like you.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.660
A guest is arriving soon.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.680
I have to prepare to greet him.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.380
Stay here and be a good boy.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:39.770
Kaiba is here?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.230
Huh?  Where's Honda?

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.020
Honda!

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:48.770
Wait up, Honda!

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:56.720
No unauthorized personnel beyond this point.

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.970
That means there's something ahead!

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:03.750
If you do not obey, you'll be removed by force-

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:04.920
Outta my way!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.920
Are you okay, Honda?

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:12.370
Huh?  What happened?

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.500
Welcome, Seto.

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:59.740
What did you do with Mokuba?

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.420
Don't worry.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:06.750
Regardless of where our destiny leads, Mokuba will be freed.

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.750
Anyway, isn't this place beautiful?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.980
It's Earth at the dawn of creation.

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:19.490
Kaiba Corporation's technology can create any world: space, lava, anything.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:27.800
It can be used to change wars, consciousness, even the course of human history.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.530
If you want to say something, just say it!

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:34.300
I'm annoyed.

00:06:34.300 --> 00:06:38.370
You have this great technology, but you only use it for your silly games.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:45.950
Seto, let's determine which of us is more suited to lead Kaiba Corporation.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:47.060
That's pointless.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:47.930
What?

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:51.550
Because you're already dead, Noa.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:53.990
I saw it with my own eyes!

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:00.070
No way...

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.220
It can't be.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:05.870
This is Noa's funeral.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:14.110
If this is real, Noa is dead.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:19.560
Then who's the Noa we've been seeing all this time?

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.790
You saw it?

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.020
Then it's easier for me to explain.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:30.030
My body is a virtual image.

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:33.370
But up here is different.

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:35.060
Look, Seto!

00:07:44.310 --> 00:07:47.770
That's my real brain.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:50.880
It holds my consciousness.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:53.660
Everyone!  Come over here!

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:56.920
Train tracks!

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:01.920
Did Kaiba come here?

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.940
I don't know.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.820
But we have no other lead.

00:08:07.820 --> 00:08:09.770
So we should go.

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:10.620
You're right.

00:08:10.620 --> 00:08:13.120
Will a train come if we wait here?

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.410
I found something good!

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:19.550
Good job, monkey!

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:25.970
I'm scared!

00:08:25.970 --> 00:08:27.740
You're going too fast!

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:31.490
What are you talking about?  Hang on!

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.490
It's too fast!

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.200
Jonouchi!  Hit the brakes!

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:43.730
Well...

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:56.010
That's your brain?

00:08:56.010 --> 00:09:01.400
Yes.  As you said, my body is dead.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:05.020
But my death was the start of everything.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:14.120
When I was born, I was the heir to Kaiba Corporation.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:17.600
I was special since birth.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:23.600
As Kaiba Corporation's successor, my life's path was already set.

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:30.400
My father hired the best people to teach me.

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:32.600
Not just academics.

00:09:32.600 --> 00:09:36.950
Music, sports, all genres.

00:09:37.160 --> 00:09:43.650
He made sure I'd be worthy of ruling from the top of the world.

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:49.250
And I worked hard to meet his expectations.

00:09:49.500 --> 00:09:51.360
If everything went as planned...

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:55.370
...neither you nor Mokuba would've had anything to do with Kaiba Corporation.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:58.860
You said life was a game.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:02.380
But that's a bit cruel for me.

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:14.100
Noa!

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:18.700
Restore him back to health!

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.000
But...

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.760
Are you talking back to me?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.500
Aren't you a doctor?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:26.160
I'm sorry but current medical technology-

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.930
You quack!

00:10:27.930 --> 00:10:29.760
I don't need your help!

00:10:49.320 --> 00:10:52.900
Human brains operate using weak electric signals.

00:10:54.160 --> 00:11:00.050
Kaiba Corporation was developing a computer AI for military operations.

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:03.800
My father transferred my memories into it.

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:11.820
I was reborn.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:18.220
The Kaiba family adopted you and Mokuba soon after.

00:11:21.340 --> 00:11:28.700
Father raised you as my rival so that I would compete and improve.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:34.870
Seto, you were never qualified to take over Kaiba Corporation.

00:11:51.180 --> 00:11:53.310
I know you disagree.

00:11:53.310 --> 00:12:00.310
So let's settle this with Duel Monsters, a game that's your specialty.

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.460
You can't complain if you lose.

00:12:03.800 --> 00:12:07.760
Don't worry.  I'll take over your body.

00:12:07.760 --> 00:12:11.970
So you can still be useful to Kaiba Corporation.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:22.980
So all my struggles and effort...  My whole life was just for you?

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:30.840
Yes.  But if you submit right now, you won't experience the humiliation of defeat.

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.440
You must be joking!

00:12:32.440 --> 00:12:33.920
Listen, Noa!

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:39.230
Ever since I was born, I've only lived for myself!

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:42.240
The road of glory leads to my future!

00:12:42.460 --> 00:12:45.740
If someone dares interfere...

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.380
I will crush him with my own hands!

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:56.120
Seto, you want to duel that badly?

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:58.350
Save your breath, Noa!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.120
I already built my deck.

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.360
My Deck Master is...

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:08.370
Come!  Kaiser Sea Horse!

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:15.310
I was dreaming of this moment for a long time.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:20.200
Let's fight, Seto!

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:22.140
Duel!

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:23.800
Here I go, Noa!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.480
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:29.460
I summon Giant Germ in attack position!

00:13:30.240 --> 00:13:33.050
And I set a card!

00:13:33.050 --> 00:13:38.060
Noa.  In this duel, the goddess of victory is on my side.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:41.560
My set card is Crush Card Virus.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:46.650
When you attack Giant Germ, its effect will activate.

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:52.450
All monsters in your hand and deck with at least 1500 attack points will be destroyed.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:54.740
I end my turn!

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.250
Here I go, Seto.  My turn.

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:03.220
I summon Chiron the Mage.

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:14.510
The exit!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:27.710
Where are we?

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:29.010
Ouch!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:30.740
Huh?

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:33.750
What is this place?

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:36.100
Yugi!  Look at that!

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.750
Kaiba!  Noa!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:41.780
Yugi.

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:44.080
Your friends are here.

00:14:44.080 --> 00:14:48.140
They'll be witnesses for our duel.

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:52.500
I'll show you my Creation Deck!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:55.000
Creation Deck?

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:58.610
I activate Chiron the Mage's effect.

00:14:59.080 --> 00:15:00.180
Mirror Of Truth!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:09.140
Chiron's Mirror Of Truth shows your card and destroys it.

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.350
Seto, your set card is...

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:14.350
Crush Card Virus!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.360
What?

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:20.760
I know all your strategies.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:22.500
Go, Chiron!

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:25.000
Attack Giant Germ!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:34.370
Giant Germ's effect activates!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.200
It can regenerate?  How tough.

00:15:40.200 --> 00:15:45.140
Even if you avoided my Crush Card Virus, I still have the advantage!

00:15:45.140 --> 00:15:46.050
My turn!

00:15:46.280 --> 00:15:51.060
I tribute Giant Germ to summon Vampire Lord!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.840
Vampire Lord attacks!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:56.530
Dark Disciple!

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:08.020
Vampire Lord's bloodsucking effect feasts on your deck.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:13.650
When you take damage, you must send one card of the type I choose to the graveyard.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:17.150
Noa, get rid of a monster card!

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.500
Well done, Seto.

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:28.890
But that wicked monster isn't suitable for the utopia that I'm creating.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:30.400
My turn.

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:33.620
A devil should return to the chaos of darkness.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:35.530
The spell card, Fissure!

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:44.880
Next, I summon Aeris.

00:16:48.170 --> 00:16:51.380
This is bad!  Kaiba doesn't have a monster to defend with!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:52.890
Go, Aeris!

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.520
Attack him directly!

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:02.000
Kaiba's life points...

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.330
He's beating Kaiba so easily.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:06.980
I set a card.

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:09.740
I end my turn.

00:17:09.740 --> 00:17:11.680
What's wrong, Seto?

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.580
I thought your Power Deck was special.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:17.810
If you don't try harder, this'll be over soon.

00:17:17.810 --> 00:17:21.810
Or are you already trying your hardest?

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:23.370
Noa...

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.550
My turn!

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:27.550
Resurrect, Vampire Lord!

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:37.180
Vampire Lord has two effects.

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:39.850
A bloodsucking effect when he attacks.

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:46.570
But when your card effect destroys him, his immortal effect resurrects him during my turn.

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:49.250
Next, I summon Slate Warrior!

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.200
In attack position!

00:17:55.110 --> 00:17:58.080
Good!  Kaiba has two monsters!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.590
Time to counterattack!

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:03.800
You're going to defile my sanctuary with your wicked Fiends?

00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:11.100
Noa, if you're the creator of the world, then I'll rule your world!

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:11.830
Here I go!

00:18:11.830 --> 00:18:13.830
Vampire Lord attacks!

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:15.400
You annoy me, Seto!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:18.040
Wicked souls must return to the soil!

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:20.060
I activate my trap card!

00:18:22.070 --> 00:18:23.760
Earthshaker!

00:18:31.220 --> 00:18:37.200
I select two Attributes, and you pick one of them.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:42.190
All monsters with that Attribute are destroyed.

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:45.800
I select Wind and Dark Attributes.

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:48.700
Seto, pick one of them.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:56.560
Vampire Lord is Dark Attribute and Slate Warrior is Wind Attribute.

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:59.210
Vampire Lord has higher attack points.

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:00.450
Well?

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:03.450
I choose Vampire Lord!

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:07.420
Vanish, Vampire Lord!

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.550
Why, Kaiba?

00:19:13.550 --> 00:19:16.750
You should keep the monster with higher attack points!

00:19:16.750 --> 00:19:18.510
No.  It's fine.

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:23.020
If a card effect destroys Vampire Lord, he can resurrect.

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:27.210
I see!  Kaiba will resurrect him next turn.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.210
I still have Slate Warrior on my field.

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:32.100
Go, Slate Warrior!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.890
Graviton Punch!

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:46.240
This is neck and neck!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:51.630
Noa and Kaiba are both using Power Decks to summon powerful monsters.

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:54.870
Whoever flinches will lose this duel.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.100
My turn.

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:03.320
When evil beings arrived on land, God washed everything away.

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:05.110
Now is that time.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:06.850
I activate my spell card!

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:08.820
Giant Flood!

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:13.970
What's that sound?

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:15.570
Brother, look!

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:24.860
We can't escape!

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.340
Slate Warrior is swept away!

00:20:51.340 --> 00:20:53.330
And the monsters in the graveyard!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:54.830
What's going on?

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:03.070
My Deck Master's ability has already been activated.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.300
Your Deck Master?

00:21:05.310 --> 00:21:09.080
Yes.  Come out, my Deck Master!

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.000
Shinato's Ark!

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:25.760
That's...

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:27.930
His Deck Master.

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:33.020
Seto, now begins the duel of creation.

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:35.330
The true beginning.

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:47.600
A giant ark appears behind Noa.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:49.460
That's Noa's Deck Master?

00:21:49.460 --> 00:21:53.300
What ability does that Deck Master have?

00:21:53.300 --> 00:21:57.500
And what's the seven turns of creation?

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:03.460
As the field's background keeps changing, Kaiba and Noa stage a fierce fight.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:06.660
I can't keep my eyes off their fight!

00:22:06.660 --> 00:22:10.460
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Invincible Deck Master
Shinato's Ark

00:22:10.460 --> 00:22:11.960
Duel, standby!

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:22.590
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:22.590 --> 00:22:31.540
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:36.510
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:40.480
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:40.910 --> 00:22:48.450
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:48.450 --> 00:22:52.020
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:56.790
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:56.790 --> 00:23:06.900
And walk it without stopping

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:14.510
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:14.740 --> 00:23:23.480
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:31.460
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:31.460 --> 00:23:41.300
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
